{"seq":1,"slug":"takeoff-speed-models","title":"起飞速度模型：快慢之争","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/recursive-self-improvement/takeoff-debate/takeoff-speed-models","wordCount":2129,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"起飞速度模型-快慢之争\">起飞速度模型：快慢之争</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前两章确立了两个事实：反馈回路真实存在但处处漏气。于是剩下的问题是本 hub 的中央问题——**一旦漏气点开始闭合，能力从人类水平推进到远超人类需要多久？**这就是起飞速度之争。把它形式化需要四个变量：增益函数的初始斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、各瓶颈对能力增长的弹性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>、已验证能力的扩散速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>、以及外部协调者的反应时滞 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>。所有著名立场都可以还原为对这四个参数的不同取值：快起飞派假设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 低（软件几乎不受物理牵制），慢起飞派假设经济系统的惯性让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 主导一切。争论两千年未有共识的原因很简单——在 2025 年之前，没有任何一个参数有过测量值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;慢端:&lt;br/&gt;汉森经济增长模型&lt;br/&gt;倍增以年计&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;双曲外推:&lt;br/&gt;鲁德曼增长轨迹&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;连续起飞:&lt;br/&gt;克里斯蒂亚诺&lt;br/&gt;数年内的陡峭连续&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;算力中心模型:&lt;br/&gt;戴维森&lt;br/&gt;参数化可计算&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;快端:&lt;br/&gt;尤德科夫斯基硬起飞&lt;br/&gt;月级到年级锁定&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;场景推演:&lt;br/&gt;AI 2027&lt;br/&gt;把参数变成时间线&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"慢端:&lt;br/&gt;汉森经济增长模型&lt;br/&gt;倍增以年计\"] --&gt; B[\"双曲外推:&lt;br/&gt;鲁德曼增长轨迹\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"连续起飞:&lt;br/&gt;克里斯蒂亚诺&lt;br/&gt;数年内的陡峭连续\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"算力中心模型:&lt;br/&gt;戴维森&lt;br/&gt;参数化可计算\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"快端:&lt;br/&gt;尤德科夫斯基硬起飞&lt;br/&gt;月级到年级锁定\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"场景推演:&lt;br/&gt;AI 2027&lt;br/&gt;把参数变成时间线\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>代表者</th>\n<th>核心机制</th>\n<th>典型结论形态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>经济惯性</td>\n<td>汉森</td>\n<td>智能只是生产要素之一，扩散受工资与市场约束</td>\n<td>增长翻倍先于智能爆炸，过程以十年计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双曲外推</td>\n<td>鲁德曼</td>\n<td>对人类经济史做超指数拟合</td>\n<td>增长率本身发散，奇点式收敛在数学上成立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续起飞</td>\n<td>克里斯蒂亚诺</td>\n<td>一年内完成「十年份」改进的比例决定格局</td>\n<td>无单点跳变，但快速连续仍可锁定优势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算力中心</td>\n<td>戴维森</td>\n<td>有效算力倍增周期被 AI 自动化递归缩短</td>\n<td>参数化输出：从数年到数十年的概率分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>场景推演</td>\n<td>AI 2027 作者组</td>\n<td>设定超人类编码员等中间里程碑做分支叙事</td>\n<td>可证伪的中期路标而非终局预言</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"慢端-把智能放进经济学\">慢端：把智能放进经济学</h2><p>汉森的立场来自增长经济学的第一性原理：工业革命以来人均增长的每一次跃迁都伴随要素的重新定价，而非单一要素的独舞。数字智能出现后，它首先要进入劳动力市场——按边际产出领工资、受资本存量约束、被制度吸收；即便智能可以无限复制，<strong>算力与芯片不能</strong>，于是短期内「更多智能体」依然撞上同一面物理墙。他给出的参照系是人类整体经济的翻倍周期：从数千年的狩猎采集翻倍到工业时代的百年翻倍再到战后的二三十年翻倍，惯性巨大。鲁德曼为 Open Philanthropy 做的增长轨迹建模则展示了另一个极端：若直接对世界 GDP 的千年序列拟合超指数形式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected group after &#x27;^&#x27; at position 14: y(t)\\propto(t^̲_-t)^{-\\beta}\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">y(t)\\propto(t^_-t)^{-\\beta}</span></span>，数学上会得到增长率发散的有限时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected group after &#x27;^&#x27; at position 2: t^̲_\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">t^_</span></span>——这个练习的价值不在预测而在警示：纯外推不包含任何瓶颈信息，它告诉你历史曲线有多陡，却不告诉你下一堵墙在哪里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"中间-连续起飞的关键比例\">中间：连续起飞的关键比例</h2><p>克里斯蒂亚诺 2018 年的《Takeoff Speeds》把辩论从口号升级为可讨论的结构。他的核心洞察是：真正的分界不是「有没有跳变」，而是<strong>改进的年化速率与系统总量的比值</strong>。定义一个思想实验量：如果未来十年的全部能力提升被压缩进一年内完成，世界的应对方式将与均匀分布截然不同——安全校准来不及迭代、地缘博弈按小时计时、先发者的优势无法被追赶。他同时指出常被忽略的一点：即使起飞完全连续、没有单点跳变，只要速率足够快，错位风险（misalignment）反而更大，因为校准技术的更新周期跟不上部署周期。这篇论文的另一贡献是诚实的自我定位：它列出了自己无法回答的问题清单（硬件约束多紧、算法进步能否独立驱动、扩散多快），等于承认快慢之争在当时仍是先验对先验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把争论变成参数-算力中心模型\">把争论变成参数：算力中心模型</h2><p>戴维森 2023 年发布的算力中心起飞模型做了克里斯蒂安诺清单里的事：给每个未知量一个分布，然后蒙特卡洛。模型的骨架是把有效算力的倍增周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 当状态变量——当前约四年翻倍的硬件节奏叠加算法贡献（语言模型上算法侧约每 8 个月等效减半所需算力，见<a href=\"real-bottlenecks\">真实瓶颈</a>）——再引入唯一的反馈机制：当 AI 能承担研发中占比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的工作时，倍增周期按下式递归收缩：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{t+1} = \\frac{\\tau_t}{1 + \\alpha\\, s_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 刻画自动化对研发速度的转化效率。这个一行方程就是整场争论的数学压缩体：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 取低值时模型退化为正常世界，取高值时倍增周期雪崩式缩短、数年内耗尽几十年的算力规划。模型的价值不在给出唯一答案——它的输出是一族场景及其触发条件——而在于把「你信快还是信慢」翻译成「你认为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是多少」，从此每个立场都欠数据一份交代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"场景推演-给参数装上日期\">场景推演：给参数装上日期</h2><p>参数化模型仍嫌抽象，2025 年 4 月发布的《AI 2027》走完了最后一公里。Kokotajlo 等四位作者把核心争议锚定在一个可检验的中期命题上——<strong>超人类编码员</strong>（比最强人类工程师更快更好地完成全部软件任务的系统）将在何时出现——然后以此为分叉点展开两条叙事主线：「竞赛」支线里研发自动化自我强化、能力在数月内失控攀升，「减速」支线里治理与事故让回路被人为掐断。这份文档的方法论地位在于它主动邀请证伪：每个里程碑都标了月份，写错了就记录在案。它与 METR 的时间倍增线构成了绝配——前者提供带日期的路标，后者提供逐季度的里程表，两者的对照本身就是一场持续进行的校准实验，结果如何记入<a href=\"forecasting-practice\">专家预测的校准记录</a>。至于路标之间隔着哪些物理与制度的墙，下一篇逐一清点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式-辩论中的三种循环\">反模式：辩论中的三种循环</h2><p>起飞速度之争之所以长期空转，是因为参与者反复落入三个循环。</p>\n<p>第一是<strong>定义循环</strong>：「起飞」到底指能力翻倍、指超越人类、还是指不可逆地锁定单极？各方用同一词汇指代不同对象，于是争论变成两条平行线。第二是<strong>参数循环</strong>：用「你会不会担心」这类态度问题替代「你的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取值多少」这类定量问题，把可检验的分歧退化成立场表态。第三是<strong>证据循环</strong>：拿一个支持己方的历史类比（工业革命、核武器、互联网）当作论证，而类比本身不带参数、不可证伪，只能强化先验而非更新先验。</p>\n<p>跳出循环的判据是戴维森式的一句话：<strong>每个立场都该欠数据一份交代</strong>。把它落实为三个提问——你说的起飞是哪一个可测量事件？你假设的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 落在什么区间？哪些观测会让你改变取值？——能答出这三问的讨论才进入实证阶段，答不出的仍停在修辞层。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>定义循环</strong>：用同一词指不同对象，争论实为平行线。</li>\n<li><strong>参数循环</strong>：用态度问题替代定量参数，把分歧退化为表态。</li>\n<li><strong>证据循环</strong>：以不可证伪的历史类比强化先验，而非更新先验。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>快慢之争的本质是四个参数的分歧：增益斜率、瓶颈弹性、扩散速度、反应时滞。</li>\n<li>汉森押注经济惯性，克里斯蒂亚诺证明连续起飞也可以危险，鲁德曼的双曲外推则警示纯外推不含瓶颈信息。</li>\n<li>戴维森把立场压缩成一个倍增周期递归式，AI 2027 给参数装上可证伪的日期——争论已成为缺数据的实证科学。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"起飞速度模型：快慢之争","id":"起飞速度模型-快慢之争"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"慢端：把智能放进经济学","id":"慢端-把智能放进经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"中间：连续起飞的关键比例","id":"中间-连续起飞的关键比例"},{"level":2,"text":"把争论变成参数：算力中心模型","id":"把争论变成参数-算力中心模型"},{"level":2,"text":"场景推演：给参数装上日期","id":"场景推演-给参数装上日期"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式：辩论中的三种循环","id":"反模式-辩论中的三种循环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"METR 时间倍增线与研发加速测量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/recursive-self-improvement/evidence-today/rnd-acceleration-metr"},"next":{"title":"真实瓶颈：物理、数据与验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/recursive-self-improvement/takeoff-debate/real-bottlenecks"}}